---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Grow a Garden"
  description="The Xychen section for Roblox Grow a Garden guides, tips, game information, and updates."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Roblox · Game coverage</p>
      <h1>Grow a <span>Garden.</span></h1>
      <p class="page-lead">A dedicated section for guides, useful details, discoveries, and game updates.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section-block">
    <div class="container narrow-content prose">
      <h2>What belongs here</h2>
      <p>Game mechanics, beginner-friendly guides, tips, item and feature explanations, and update coverage can be organized here as the research and publishing workflow is added.</p>
      <h2>Source and status labels</h2>
      <p>Official announcements will be distinguished from community reports. Any leak, rumor, or unverified claim must carry a clear unconfirmed label, a date, and its source.</p>
      <p class="notice">This section is a structural starting point. It does not yet contain a verified game database or published update feed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
